# The sibling checkouts the pipelines make inside the workspace. `Dockerfile` does `COPY . .`, so
# without these a build that runs after `.github/workflows/ci.yml`'s checkout (or after
# `Jenkinsfile`'s `Preflight`, whose `.jenkins-lib` is only removed in `post`) ships another
# repository's source into the build stage and invalidates the layer cache on its every commit.
# `.chemclaw3-mock` is the workflow's `oidc-mock` job's checkout of Chemclaw3_mock.
# Derived and held against the pipelines by `tests/delivery.test.ts`.
.chemclaw3
.chemclaw3-mock
.jenkins-lib
